name: Liquidation — big shop discount
author: corpus
description: >-
  Liquidation makes all cards and packs in the shop 50% cheaper. Tier-2 voucher: requires
  Clearance Sale bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases:
  huge discount, cheap shop, buy everything, economy flood.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Liquidation
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - voucher: OverstockPlus
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: GoldenJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: ToTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
